title: Server Technology Sentry PDU/CDU: Temperature sensors
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/power/servertech
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the temperature sensors (external probes) of Server Technology
 Sentry PDUs/CDUs. Both MIB generations are supported: Sentry3-MIB devices
 (e.g. "Sentry Smart CDU", "Sentry Switched CDU", sysObjectID .1.3.6.1.4.1.1718.3)
 and Sentry4-MIB devices (sysObjectID .1.3.6.1.4.1.1718.4).

 By default the thresholds configured on the device are used (Sentry3: low/high
 threshold, Sentry4: low/high warning and alarm). They can be overridden with
 the standard rule "Temperature", which also offers output unit, trend
 computation and the device-level handling mode.

 Sensor problems reported by the device (lost, read error, no communication)
 are shown as CRIT. Values in Fahrenheit are converted automatically.

item:
 The sensor ID followed by the sensor name, e.g. {A1 Temp_Humid_Sensor_A1}.

discovery:
 One service is created for each connected temperature sensor. Sensor slots
 reported as "not found" are ignored.
